# Files `semgrep scan` skips (make semgrep). Without this file Semgrep uses a built-in list that
# also skips test code (`test/`, `tests/`, `testsuite/`, `*_test.go`); then the rule
# bothy-go-tls-verify, which holds for tests too (docs/spec/19-security.md SEC-TLS-4), would
# never see a test. This file repeats the built-in list of Semgrep 1.180.0 without the test
# paths; rules that cover only production code exclude test paths in their own `paths`.
# Semgrep scans only files tracked by git, so ignored local content needs no entry here.

# Version control
.git
.svn
_darcs

# Build outputs and vendored code
build/
vendor/
dist/
*.min.js
.env/
.tox/

# Package managers
node_modules/
.npm/
.yarn/
.venv/
_opam/
_build/
_cargo/
